			"notes": "### Updates\n- Version updated to 1.21.5.\n- Spawn eggs for Lost, Ender Cube, Silver Golem, and Trout Fish have been updated to match the new style.\n- MC-Extended profession names are now using the `mc-extended` namespace instead of the `minecraft` namespace.\n- Gradle version updated to 8.12.\n- Fabric loom version updated to 1.10.\n\n### Fixes\n- Corrected the accidental too high stats of corundum and silver tools.\n- Resolved the issue where the plant specimen item was only available in the MC-Extended group.\n- Addressed the problem of spinach, onion, and tomato patches not spawning.\n\n### Changes\n- Adjusted trout fish size variations from 1.5, 1, 0.5 to 1.25, 1, 0.75."
		},
